{"headword":"מַרְפֵּא²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10\">Ec 10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 4\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.4\">4</a> <strong>healing, cure, health</strong> (usually fig.);—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְפֵּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.19\">Je 14:19</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְפֵּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.15\">8:15</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְפֵּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.4\">Pr 15:4</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>healing, cure</em>, of national woes, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.15\">Je 8:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.19\">14:19b</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁלוֹם</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.6\">33:6</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרֻכָה</span>); especially <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵין לָנוּ מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.19\">Je 14:19a</a> <em>there is no cure for us</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד לְאֵין מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.16\">2 Ch 36:16</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig. of pers., <em>health, profit</em>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.22\">Pr 4:22</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיִּים</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.18\">12:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.17\">13:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.24\">16:24</a>; with spiritual implic. <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:20\" href=\"/Malachi.3.20\">Mal 3:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵין מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.15\">Pr 6:15</a> = <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.1\">29:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לֵב מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.30\">14:30</a> <em>a mind of health</em> (healthy, composed, mind), cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, מ\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_מ\">מ׳</a> alone = <em>composure</em> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:4\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.4\">Ec 10:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ לְשׁוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.4\">Pr 15:4</a> <em>healing of the tongue</em>, = a soothing tongue (Toy)."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"lit., of disease, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְאֵין מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.18\">2 Ch 21:18</a>."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB09484","strong_numbers":["4832","4832"],"next_hw":"רָפַד","prev_hw":"יִרְפְּאֵל²","all_cited":true,"alt_headwords":[{"word":"מַרְפֵּה"}],"quotes":[],"GK":["5340","5341","5342"],"TWOT":["2196c","2196c"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}